WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Then our army

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,690
Can suppress any place

3
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,490
Why is this stuff so delicious, General Xiao?

4
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:07,210
You're right, if that's really the case

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,570
We can even fight directly in the future

6
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:09,570
They live in the army

7
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,970
Who says it isn't? General Mr. Fan

8
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:13,050
This stuff is so delicious

9
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,370
If only we could have this food during the war

10
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:15,330
What the hell are we afraid of?

11
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:19,310
I'll try to buy some more planting things tomorrow. General, I'm sorry.

12
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:22,390
There were five children in the city. They had cold and high fever. They didn’t call the doctor.

13
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:24,110
But the doctor said there is no medicine

14
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,870
Besieged by the Louju army for three years

15
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,950
We've run out of all the best medicine here.

16
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:30,190
The fever is very serious. I'll find a way, sir.

17
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:34,160
Could you please go and take care of it? I'll go see the general.

18
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,440
I have one more thing to report to you. Tell me.

19
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:39,520
What does it mean that someone is staring at us in Shazhou City?

20
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,960
We suspect they are from Qinglong Village

21
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,280
Qinglong Village is right

22
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,040
A copycat suddenly appeared in the past two days

23
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,400
There's a group of people in there

24
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,280
It is possible that we are the people left behind by the army living in the building.

25
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,360
It took in some of the surrounding refugees and gathered together.

26
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,440
The purpose is to keep an eye on us

27
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,720
It might even cause harassment to us, right?

28
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:54,840
a group of refugees

29
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,320
How dare you harass us?

30
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,040
There are definitely people from the Louju military camp inside.

31
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,400
Deliberately rounding up the refugees
